36168,"title":"","content":"Check out the Inferno book boom you got the demons your asking for","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-20T15:24:23-08:00","id":1436298,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Basic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1435615-evil-idea-shop-what-if-the-demon-the-fallen-were-to-arrive-at-a-god-machine-world?p=1436168#post1436168\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Check out the Inferno book boom you got the demons your asking for</div> </div> </div> </div>Hum, hadn't seen it, but the things is, I wanted the setting of D:the Descent with the PCs as the Demons from D:the Fallen, it's not simply &quot;having traditional devils in CoD&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Strange... When coincidence seems too convenient, I prefer to call it fate.</i><br /> <br /> <b><sup>-Blood Omen: Legacy of Kain</sup> </b>d=","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25534-banu_saulot","name":"Banu_Saulot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25534_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"335"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-20T15:39:47-08:00","id":1436305,"title":"","content":"Sounds like an awesome idea. And I agree, both WoD Inferno and the Demon Translation Guide might be very helpful.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-23T16:30:02-07:00","id":1441154,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Banu_Saulot</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1435615-evil-idea-shop-what-if-the-demon-the-fallen-were-to-arrive-at-a-god-machine-world?p=1436298#post1436298\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hum, hadn't seen it, but the things is, I wanted the setting of D:the Descent with the PCs as the Demons from D:the Fallen, it's not simply &quot;having traditional devils in CoD&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah the thing you want is inferno then. Their devils and demons. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-23T16:55:36-07:00","id":1441159,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Basic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1435615-evil-idea-shop-what-if-the-demon-the-fallen-were-to-arrive-at-a-god-machine-world?p=1441154#post1441154\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yeah the thing you want is inferno then. Their devils and demons.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nope, for this one you want the Demon Translation Guide. Inferno is focused around demons as antagonists and temptations, not as protagonists; the playable template provided is a human who's made a faustian deal with a malicious possessing demon. Inferno demons have simplistic traits, their relation to Hell and a society and interrelation between demons is intentionally ambiguous and shrouded in mystery to the point of leaving open the possibility that Hell is purely notional and demons are ultimately just human vices given form, and their activities primarily just revolve around gaining power by enticing humans to sin.<br /> <br /> The Demon Translation Guide will equip you pretty well to run the Fallen in a God-Machine setting, complete with reflavored descriptions of demonic form abilities from Descent to integrate as Fallen apocalyptic forms. The closer you cleave to the cat-and-mouse conflict between angel and demon in Descent's model, the better you'll do; the Translation Guide generally does better translating major structural themes <i>from</i> Descent than <i>into</i> Descent. (There's very little detail or attention given to the cultivation of thralls and the harvest of faith, or the threat of losing your anchor to your body and being returned to Hell or consumed. The system provided for testing whether evocations are Tormented or not is inappropriately harsh. Other subjects less directly relevant to the core game structure are handled quite well: support for the different Houses, the Lore evocations themselves, Merits and Flaws.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}